344
00:32:17,735 --> 00:32:18,375
bir plan

345
00:32:18,375 --> 00:32:20,755
ortaya koymuşlardı.

346
00:32:20,755 --> 00:32:22,096
Bundan dolayı da

347
00:32:22,096 --> 00:32:23,875
Nihat Erim hükümeti

348
00:32:23,875 --> 00:32:25,495
tabiri caizse

349
00:32:25,495 --> 00:32:27,816
bir kutla

350
00:32:27,816 --> 00:32:28,995
hükümet olmaktan

351
00:32:28,995 --> 00:32:29,795
öteye gidemedi.

352
00:32:30,455 --> 00:32:30,675
Yani

353
00:32:30,675 --> 00:32:33,215
orada darbeyi yapan

354
00:32:33,215 --> 00:32:34,655
Memdut Tahmaç

355
00:32:34,655 --> 00:32:35,355
ve ekibinin

356
00:32:35,355 --> 00:32:36,435
